      ],
      "en": "Let’s fear therefore, lest perhaps anyone of you should seem to have come short of a promise of entering into his rest.",
      "ko": "그러므로 우리는 두려워할지니 그의 안식에 들어갈 약속이 남아 있을지라도 너희 중에 혹 미치지 못할 자가 있을까 함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "0e85f2023a7f0a3b4d2463a95c6004763c747f1bff79d978417de3ddd33752f9",
      "translation_text_hash": "7e24ac1ac385c59b39a6c7c92a623fb95a5732240996fb466c1542de8ee65f41",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
