        {
          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "For indeed we have had good news preached to us, even as they also did, but the word they heard didn’t profit them, because it wasn’t mixed with faith by those who heard.",
      "ko": "저희와 같이 우리도 복음 전함을 받은 자이나 그러나 그 들은바 말씀이 저희에게 유익되지 못한 것은 듣는 자가 믿음을 화합지 아니함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "348360eb1f1a3b7f83aff9ee71887a809e8044b89963170f0ee84cce4d4299b3",
      "translation_text_hash": "0241e9545a0cf57d26e55121e68e1e2983f2eb83f7a5c7d7033aba783a503de8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
