      "en": "and in this place again, “They will not enter into my rest.”",
      "ko": "또 다시 거기 저희가 내 안식에 들어오지 못하리라 하였으니",
      "source_text_hash": "5665cd7fc0f7a33a93f0d53e149025a1c0a9c64fd2d4eb65ebb8ed1807c79b0e",
      "translation_text_hash": "3525e1d3d376066b229b20afbe93af3e01878cb9dab5b6987fc62b6adb60361c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
