      "en": "For if Joshua had given them rest, he would not have spoken afterward of another day.",
      "ko": "만일 여호수아가 저희에게 안식을 주었더면 그 후에 다른 날을 말씀하지 아니하셨으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "f87e97c3a4031126c170d49ff3acbc55c5fce5cd6f60dc761ce1d5bb0d38fc4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "87e44739f43e11931d74dd467253d3ffc59dab4cd3fe6e336358410a757e24f3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
