      "en": "There remains therefore a Sabbath rest for the people of God.",
      "ko": "그런즉 안식할 때가 하나님의 백성에게 남아 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "1a1a7e5927603a4776720db6cf37d85ebbe54712397d7cec1d55e0bb12030c00",
      "translation_text_hash": "5c1da8629c97c30234d006bcd4a6d7904da0fb5e23a53b02837907a2dcdea0ee",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그런즉 안식할 때가 하나님의 백성에게 남아 있도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5c1da8629c97c30234d006bcd4a6d7904da0fb5e23a53b02837907a2dcdea0ee"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:HEB:4:10",
      "sequence": 30021,
      "chapter_label": "HEB 4",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
